WEBVTT

00:11:58.238 --> 00:12:00.926
for dealing with
her procrastination habit.

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:04.166
And it's a trick that lines up
with what some researchers recommend.

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:06.706
MA: I had another name
that I grew up with,

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:08.616
and that gave me two names.

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:10.786
So I had a double identity.

00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:12.517
So Margaret does the writing

00:12:12.541 --> 00:12:15.596
and the other one does everything else.

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:18.336
AG: Her alter ego's name is Peggy.

00:12:18.360 --> 00:12:21.486
MA: It's a Scottish
diminutive of "Margaret."

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:25.066
AG: Do you actually refer to yourself
by both identities in your head?

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:27.646
MA: Absolutely.
AG: Seriously?

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:30.986
MA: Well, you see
what a range it gives me.